<title>USA: Burnsville, Minn., $1 mln, won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Burnsville, Minn., $1 mln, won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said it won $1.230 million of Burnsville, Minn., general obligation taxable tax increment bonds, series 1997C, with a true interest cost of 7.04 percent.</p>
</text>
